  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【佐賀県の温泉完全ガイド】名湯ランキング＆露天風呂付きおすすめ旅館10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">佐賀県が誇る風情ある温泉街や隠れ家温泉リゾート。泉質の特徴や美肌効果、四季折々の絶景を楽しめる露天風呂、地元佐賀県の旬の食材（佐賀牛・呼子の活イカ造り・竹崎カニ・嬉野温泉湯どうふなど）を味わえる極上宿を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 佐賀県の温泉エリアとおすすめポイント</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-2\">佐賀県の豊かな自然に包まれながら楽しむ名湯ステイ。記念日のお祝いから週末の癒やし旅まで、心に残る上質な時間を過ごせます。</p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-950\">\n    <strong>注目の温泉・宿泊エリア：</strong> 嬉野・武雄・古湯・たら竹崎・唐津温泉（紅葉露天・雪見風呂・最高峰A5ランク・佐賀牛会席）</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 佐賀県の主要エリア別おすすめ温泉宿</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-amber-500 font-bold\">♨️</span> 嬉野温泉・武雄・唐津エリアの温泉・宿\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">佐賀県を代表する観光名所・絶景スポット・名湯が凝縮された一番人気エリア。</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-stone-50 p-3 rounded-xl\"><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F184266%2F184266.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>奥武雄温泉　風の森</strong></a>（武雄市西川登町小田志17275 ／ 評価 ⭐4.87・目安 ¥33,880〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F28966%2F28966.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>日本料理　水野旅館＜唐津＞</strong></a>（唐津市東城内4-50 ／ 評価 ⭐4.86・目安 ¥20,350〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68087%2F68087.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>武雄温泉　懐石宿　扇屋</strong></a>（武雄市武雄町武雄7399 ／ 評価 ⭐4.78・目安 ¥24,800〜）</li></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">💡 佐賀県の温泉宿選び＆予約のコツ</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n  <li><strong>客室露天風呂・貸切風呂：</strong> プライベートな空間で温泉を満喫したいカップル・ファミリーに大人気</li>\n  <li><strong>料理自慢の宿：</strong> 佐賀県ならではの郷土料理やブランド牛、新鮮な山海の幸を堪能できるプランを選択</li>\n  <li><strong>お得な予約タイミング：</strong> 楽天トラベルの「5と0のつく日」や限定クーポンを活用してお得に予約</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏆 佐賀県の温泉旅館・ホテルおすすめランキング10選【楽天トラベル公式データ】</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/184266/184266.jpg\" alt=\"奥武雄温泉　風の森\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第1位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">奥武雄温泉　風の森</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県武雄市西川登町小田志17275 ｜ 🚃 嬉野ICから車で４分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.87（107件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥33,880〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">森の中、ふたりの世界。約5500坪の敷地に全11の露天風呂付客室。純重曹泉と創作会席、貸切サウナも。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F184266%2F184266.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/28966/28966.jpg\" alt=\"日本料理　水野旅館＜唐津＞\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第2位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">日本料理　水野旅館＜唐津＞</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県唐津市東城内4-50 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ唐津駅より車で約５分／長崎自動車道多久ＩＣより４０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.86（108件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥20,350〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">“美食と歴史”を堪能する宿。玄界灘の海の幸と唐津焼、歴史ある空間が織りなすひとときをお愉しみください</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F28966%2F28966.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68087/68087.jpg\" alt=\"武雄温泉　懐石宿　扇屋\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第3位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">武雄温泉　懐石宿　扇屋</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県武雄市武雄町武雄7399 ｜ 🚃 長崎自動車道武雄北方ＩＣより国道３４号線経由で５㎞、又はＪＲ佐世保線武雄温泉駅下車徒歩１２分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.78（274件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥24,800〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">もっと佐賀旅クーポン配布中！『料理の鉄人』に出演した主人が織り成す本格懐石料理。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68087%2F68087.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/78103/78103.jpg\" alt=\"割烹旅館　筑前屋\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第4位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">割烹旅館　筑前屋</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県唐津市呼子町殿の浦1659 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ　唐津駅よりお車にて３０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.73（110件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥16,500〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">唐津市呼子港にある割烹旅館です。抜群のロケーションと新鮮な魚料理を存分にお楽しみ下さい。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F78103%2F78103.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/53097/53097.jpg\" alt=\"太良嶽温泉ホテル　蟹御殿\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第5位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">太良嶽温泉ホテル　蟹御殿</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県藤津郡太良町大浦乙316-3 ｜ 🚃 武雄北方ＩＣ車で６０分（４９８号線を鹿島方面に２０７号線を諫早方面に）・長崎本線肥前大浦駅より無料送迎有　要予約</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.68（605件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥47,190〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">竹崎蟹、サウナ、有明海の絶景を楽しめる新客室。非日常な景色で心身を開放するプレミアムリゾートです。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F53097%2F53097.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8986/8986.jpg\" alt=\"嬉野温泉　ハミルトン宇礼志野\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第6位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">嬉野温泉　ハミルトン宇礼志野</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 佐賀県嬉野市嬉野町岩屋川内288